     "price": "Adult €20, youth or senior €18, child (<6) free, family (2 adults, 2 youth) €65",
     "wikidata": "Q69513",
     "content": "Beautiful example of pseudo-Moorish Romantic architecture. You can walk there from Sintra in about an hour (uphill!) or catch a bus. You can see a good collection of furniture and the royal apartments. Tickets are sold on a timed basis. Arr",
