     "hours": "",
     "price": "Adult €13, youth or senior €10, child (<6) free, family (2 adults, 2 youth) €35",
     "wikidata": "Q532399",
     "content": "The summer estate of the Portuguese royal family from the middle ages until the 1910 republican revolution. Built in several steps, the oldest standing parts is a chapel built by King Dinis I during the 14th century. Around 1400 King John I",
     "editions": 26,
